{"title": "Volo's Ersatz Eye", "pageid": 4222, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Volo's_Ersatz_Eye", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the passive feature that can be obtained via surgery see <a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)\">Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png/300px-Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png/300px-Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Volos_Ersatz_Eye_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Volo's Ersatz Eye</b> is a common item.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>While the ersatz eye is embedded in your eye socket, you can see through the tiny orb as though it were a normal eye. Can't be removed once inserted. \n</p><p>A hollow bead of white glass, carefully painted to resemble  a realistic eye. Its tarnished brass fittings hum with a tinge of magic.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 220 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  220  gp</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>If received through dialogue grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\">See Invisibility</a> permanently. Like the spell, this buff allows you to see creatures that are <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> within 9 metres if they fail a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</li>\n<li>Otherwise, the item is a useless bauble.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>As an item, the eye can be looted from Volo's corpse; however, in order to gain the <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\">See Invisibility</a> buff, the player character must undergo the surgery.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>To obtain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/25px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/38px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/50px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/25px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)\">Volo's Ersatz Eye</a> the player character must undergo surgery with Volo:\n<ul><li>Once <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a> has been rescued (see the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_Volo\" title=\"Rescue Volo\">Rescue Volo</a>), he must be told to find the party in camp.</li>\n<li>In camp, Volo can attempt to remove the player's tadpole via an experimental operation.</li>\n<li>Because Volo is more of a hubristic grandstander than a respectable surgeon, this operation is unsuccessful and leaves the player character permanently blind in their right eye. However, out of either guilt or sympathy, Volo then gives the PC the ersatz eye, which negates the blindness and grants a permanent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility_(Condition)\" title=\"See Invisibility (Condition)\">See Invisibility</a> buff.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Volo's surgery is irreversible; once inserted, the ersatz eye cannot be removed and its appearance cannot be changed with the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Mirror\" title=\"Magic Mirror\">Magic Mirror</a>.</li>\n<li>The eye cannot be obtained by the PC if they previously accepted <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel's</a> deal and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paid_the_Price_(Condition)\" title=\"Paid the Price (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paid the Price\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paid_the_Price_(Condition)\" title=\"Paid the Price (Condition)\">Paid the Price</a>.</li>\n<li>Unlike other companions, <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> cannot undergo Volo's procedure, nor can <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> who has no dialogue options at all if she speaks with him.</li>\n<li>In Early Access, the ersatz eye could be pickpocketed from Volo. In the full release of the game, the player must go through with his surgery in order to obtain the eye, or kill him.</li>\n<li>In Early Access, the ersatz eye provided +1 to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> and -1 to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/38px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/50px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>.</li>\n<li>The color of the Ersatz eye is very similar to \"Blue 3\"; careful discernment with a close-up of the PC's face reveals it has a brighter blue and yellow coloration (for example, in conversation scenes or while changing appearance with the Magic Mirror). If one wishes to (mostly) avoid the Heterochromia look, Blue 3 is the closest match.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 219.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 217.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg/326px-Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg/489px-Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg/652px-Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg/326px-Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"218\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Jane-katsubo-erzaz.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:20241130_VE1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"A dwarf in camp in the Shadow-Cursed Lands at night, looking at Gale. He has Volo's Ersatz eye in his right eye.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/20241130_VE1.png/667px-20241130_VE1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/20241130_VE1.png/1001px-20241130_VE1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/20241130_VE1.png/1334px-20241130_VE1.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A dwarf in camp in the Shadow-Cursed Lands at night, looking at Gale. He has Volo's Ersatz eye in his right eye.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/20241130_VE1.png/667px-20241130_VE1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/20241130_VE1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A dwarf in camp in the Shadow-Cursed Lands at night, looking at Gale. He has Volo's Ersatz eye in his right eye.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195111\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time us